# UGC AI Production Engine Rules

`CLAUDE.md` is the single source of truth. Read it before any production task.

- Execute Mandatory Checkpoint 1 (Scene, Outfit, ManyChat Keyword, Cover Headline) before Phase 3.
- Keep the reference script's length (+-10%) and meaning (70/30 rule); each clip <= 10s and <= 2.4 WPS.
- Never use 'age' or 'DM' in scripts or prompts; dialogue is brand-decoupled.
- Keep `01_Reference/` to max 10 keyframes plus the video and script txt.
- Deliverables contain exactly 4 files (.mp4, .srt, .jpg, .txt).
- Verify with `python tools/ugc_harness.py --project [PROJECT]` (7/7 PASS).
